Brand automation failure handling
title end

paragraph start
When an automation fails, it stops, keeps the last good version, writes a log line and tells a person. It never retries without limit and never publishes a half result.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Every automation has one named person who fixes it and one place where its log is kept.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
failure, what stops, what is kept, who is told, how it is fixed
code end

